WEBVTT

00:02:58.829 --> 00:03:02.163
and it was very successful and
he started a second one on

00:03:02.163 --> 00:03:04.704
the third one until he
had a chain of stores

00:03:04.954 --> 00:03:08.996
in the late 1950s. Barista was a teenager
in Southern California,

00:03:09.538 --> 00:03:13.788
and for almost a decade, he saw his
dad grow his business to 15 stores

00:03:13.913 --> 00:03:15.371
and he was really doing well.

00:03:15.371 --> 00:03:17.913
And then the large national companies,

00:03:17.913 --> 00:03:21.121
they would just open a store right
across the street practically

00:03:21.121 --> 00:03:23.454
and undercut all the prices.

00:03:23.454 --> 00:03:26.579
They literally drove all
the independent people,

00:03:26.579 --> 00:03:28.829
all the small guys out of business.

00:03:28.954 --> 00:03:33.079
By then, Barry was in his 20s watching
his father's business decline.